. * nwsaom tutorial 4: selection and influence, network-behavior co-evolution
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwsaom.
. 
. nwwebuse glasgow, nwclear

. tabulate alcohol1

            alcohol1 |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
